e existing cmd/*/test file before writing cat_test.go\n\n    acceptance_criteria:\n      - id: AC1\n        text: \"go test ./cmd/cat/... passes with all differential test cases green against the GNU reference binary\"\n      - id: AC2\n        text: Each acceptance criterion in the cat PRD has at least one corresponding named test case in cat_test.go\n      - id: AC3\n        text: Every flag listed in the cat PRD is exercised by at least one test case\n      - id: AC4\n        text: Error condition tests assert both exit code and stderr content match the GNU reference binary output\n      - id: AC5\n        text: cat_test.go compiles cleanly with no warnings under golangci-lint\n```","stop_reason":null,"session_id":"c4ad9d3f-b159-4e27-8e32-624170b307da","total_cost_usd":0.3405045,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":15888,"cache_read_input_tokens":19189,"output_tokens":9264,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":15888,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-sonnet-4-6":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":9264,"cacheReadInputTokens":19189,"cacheCreationInputTokens":15888,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.3405045,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000}},"permission_denials":[],"uuid":"c089aca7-d47b-43d9-9138-16d1d9eb2700"}
